{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065102/block/singleImage/3274660/df/01M81RBX8PWD5SSW4GEWW3QPTD.webp?updatedAt=1795355532\"/><figcaption>薈淳周六(21日)連環錄得3宗成交，合共套現約2,027.6萬元。</figcaption></figure><p>宏安地產 (1243) 旗下黃大仙現樓新盤「薈淳」周六 (21 日 ) 連環錄得 3 宗成交，包括 1 伙開放式及 2 伙兩房單位，合共套現約 2,027.6 萬元。 該 3 個單位實用面積介乎 202 至 376 方呎，成交價由 460 萬至 788.8 萬元，呎價介乎 20,713 元至 22,772 元。當中成交價最高為 20 樓 A 室，實用面積 376 方呎，兩房開放式廚房間隔，售價 788.8 萬元，呎價 20,979 元。 「薈淳」位於黃大仙飛鳳街，設 1 座住宅大樓，提供 195 伙。 即睇黃大仙薈淳最新資訊 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.734504+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:52:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T10:56:52.580516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:18.023960+00:00","content_hash":"796c931f96863e4d8d62154481e0e634deb952c44900a923307c84cdeb0c9e8f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.734504+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}